                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[i]Sadly, the girl featured on the store page video does NOT come with the game. [/i]\n\n[spoiler]\n[h1]Experienced on Windows Mixed Reality[/h1]\n\nWhole game took me 5 minutes to complete. It's a 180 wave melee non-shooter. You basically wave your nunchucks or nunchuka around and hit enemies that run right up to you in a frontal cone. There are two stages with different environments. I believe there are 10 waves for each stage. The one enemy model is unique for that stage. Then there is the boss fight unique for each stage. \n\nThis is just mindless arcade action with little challenge, except for trying to get a higher grade. You kind of have to use your imagination to get some fun out of it. This is perfect if you have such an imagination or for kids. If you're looking for a challenge, I would pass on this.\n\nYou can view my review & full gameplay here: https://youtu.be/8yqJfhckt-o\n\n[b]Sale Price Rating 5/10. This should be a .99 cents game. I am being super generous with my positive rating. However, it's in Early Access and better combat, more weapons, & more stages are being promised ... but not the girl in the video.[/b] [/spoiler]",
